%%{init: {'theme':'base','themeVariables':{'background':'#ffffff','primaryColor':'#ffffff','primaryTextColor':'#000000','lineColor':'#333333'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant KOS as kOS CPU
    participant Boot as boot.ks
    participant Main as system/main.ks
    participant Load as system/loadShip.ks
    participant Ship as ships/family/Name.ks
    participant Prog as programs/family.ks
    participant Lib as lib/*.ks
    participant FD as flightData

    KOS->>Boot: vessel unpacks
    Boot->>Main: RUNPATH main.ks
    Main->>Main: set shipName/Series/Variant
    Main->>FD: initialize LEXICON
    Main->>Load: RUNPATH loadShip.ks
    Load->>Load: resolve shipFile from SHIP:NAME
    Load->>Ship: RUNPATH ship script
    Ship->>Prog: RUNONCEPATH family program
    Prog->>Lib: RUNONCEPATH launch/tracking/booster/detonation/downrange
    Ship->>Prog: initializeFamily(charge, variant)
    Ship->>Lib: initializeLaunch()
    Ship->>Lib: countdownLaunch(10)
    Ship->>Lib: launchShipClampTWR(...)
    Lib-->>FD: phase = "ascent"
    Ship->>Lib: trackFlightStats()
    Ship->>Lib: monitorEngines(...)
    Note over Ship,Lib: Post-launch arming (per vehicle):<br/>armBoosterSeperation / armDownrangeGuidance /<br/>armAltitudeDetonation / armParachute
    Ship->>Lib: arm post-launch systems(...)
    Note over Lib,FD: WHEN triggers update<br/>flightData & write logs
    Ship->>KOS: WAIT UNTIL FALSE (hold open)
